OpenMoji attribution
====================

The monochrome emoji bitmaps in src/helpers/ui/EmojiGlyphData.h are adapted
from OpenMoji 17.0.0 black artwork.

All emojis designed by OpenMoji -- the open-source emoji and icon project.
